{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":1252400,"duration_api_ms":1311332,"num_turns":105,"result":"All checks pass. Here is the final deliverable:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"project_id\": \"tanksim-6e5.5.4.2\",\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"summary\": \"Implemented simplified denitrification in suboxic substrate zones with Monod kinetics, stoichiometric DOC consumption, alkalinity production, denitrifier activity maturation, and cumulative N₂ gas export tracking in the budget ledger.\",\n  \"files_changed\": [\n    {\n      \"path\": \"crates/tank_core/src/types/process.rs\",\n      \"description\": \"Added 5 named denitrification parameters (vmax, K_NO3, K_DOC, pore-water mixing factor, activity maturation days) with serde defaults and Default impl.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"crates/tank_data/data/process/default.toml\",\n      \"description\": \"Added denitrification kinetics section with default values for all 5 parameters.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"crates/tank_core/src/types/biology.rs\",\n      \"description\": \"Added denitrifier_activity_index field to MicrobeState with serde default and Default::default() = 0.0.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"crates/tank_core/src/types/state.rs\",\n      \"description\": \"Added cumulative_n2_export_mg_n field to TankState with serde default and new() = 0.0.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"crates/tank_core/src/types/mod.rs\",\n      \"description\": \"Added total_nitrogen_mg to public budget re-exports.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"crates/tank_core/src/systems/nitrogen_cycle.rs\",\n      \"description\": \"Core implementation: DENITRIFICATION_DOC_MG_C_PER_MG_N constant, denitrification step 5 with dual Monod kinetics (NO₃ and DOC), pore-water mixing factor, activity scaling, temperature factor, clamping to available substrates, DOC→DIC carbon routing, alkalinity production, cumulative export tracking. Added update_daily_denitrifier_activity() public function with exponential approach toward target.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"crates/tank_core/src/engine.rs\",\n      \"description\": \"Wired denitrification into budget recording (2 metrics, 2 trace notes), added update_daily_denitrifier_activity() call in daily biofilter maturity stage, added activity index trace note.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"crates/tank_core/tests/denitrification.rs\",\n      \"description\": \"New test file with 12 tests covering: NO₃ removal, NO₃ requirement, DOC requirement, suboxic volume scaling, alkalinity production, budget export tracking, fully-oxic negligibility, Monod concentration dependence, stoichiometry, DOC scaling, nitrate accumulation reduction (integration), and activity ramp (integration).\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"tests\": {\n    \"total\": 12,\n    \"passed\": 12,\n    \"failed\": 0,\n    \"test_names\": [\n      \"test_denitrification_removes_no3\",\n      \"test_denitrification_requires_no3\",\n      \"test_denitrification_requires_doc\",\n      \"test_denitrification_rate_scales_with_suboxic_volume\",\n      \"test_denitrification_produces_alkalinity\",\n      \"test_denitrification_tracked_as_export\",\n      \"test_denitrification_negligible_when_fully_oxic\",\n      \"test_denitrification_monod_concentration_based\",\n      \"test_denitrification_stoichiometry\",\n      \"test_denitrification_rate_scales_with_doc\",\n      \"test_denitrification_reduces_nitrate_accumulation\",\n      \"test_denitrification_activity_ramp\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"quality_checks\": {\n    \"cargo_test\": \"pass (12/12 denitrification tests; 1 pre-existing failure in thermal_reproduction_penalty unrelated to this work)\",\n    \"cargo_clippy\": \"pass (no warnings)\",\n    \"cargo_fmt\": \"pass\"\n  },\n  \"acceptance_criteria\": {\n    \"monod_kinetics\": \"Implemented dual Monod (NO₃ and DOC) with named K_half parameters\",\n    \"n2_gas_export\": \"NO₃ removed as N₂, tracked via cumulative_n2_export_mg_n and budget metric nitrogen_cycle.denitrification_n2_export_mg_n\",\n    \"named_parameters\": \"All 5 constants are named fields in ProcessParams with serde defaults\",\n    \"activity_maturation\": \"Exponential approach from 0→1 over configurable maturation_days, updated daily\",\n    \"alkalinity_production\": \"Uses pre-existing DENITRIFICATION_ALK_MEQ_PER_MG_N = 1/14.007 meq/mg N\",\n    \"stoichiometry\": \"5CH₂O + 4NO₃⁻ + 4H⁺ → 2N₂↑ + 5CO₂ + 7H₂O; DOC_MG_C_PER_MG_N = 5/4 × 12/14.007 ≈ 1.0714\",\n    \"carbon_conservation\": \"DOC consumed routes to DIC (dissolved_inorganic_carbon_mg_c_total)\"\n  },\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"Pre-existing test failure thermal_reproduction_penalty is unrelated to this work and fails on current master.\",\n    \"Denitrification step is placed between nitrifier decay and alkalinity commitment in the nitrogen cycle.\",\n    \"Suboxic pore volume computed from substrate_suboxic_pore_volume_cm3() method.\",\n    \"Rate clamped to min(available NO₃, stoichiometric DOC limit) to prevent negative pools.\"\n  ]\n}\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"56a1699d-9f30-40b3-9914-e4422c682f4c","total_cost_usd":8.00567695,"usage":{"input_tokens":92,"cache_creation_input_tokens":189185,"cache_read_input_tokens":10136036,"output_tokens":46175,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":189185,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":189,"outputTokens":15244,"cacheReadInputTokens":1135982,"cacheCreationInputTokens":144612,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.3707722,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":1942,"outputTokens":51635,"cacheReadInputTokens":10302527,"cacheCreationInputTokens":189289,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":7.63490475,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"a3876f